<div class="finance-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">残高の履歴</p><h1>月次資産推移</h1></div><%= link_to "＋ 月次残高を記録", new_finance_snapshot_path, class: "button" %></div>
<% if @records.any? %><section class="finance-card"><h2>総資産の推移</h2><div class="history-bars"><% max = [@records.map(&:total).max, 1].max %><% @records.each do |record| %><div class="history-bar-row"><span><%= record.month.strftime("%Y/%m") %></span><div class="history-track"><div style="width: <%= [[record.total.fdiv(max) * 100, 0].max, 100].min %>%"></div></div><strong><%= money(record.total) %></strong></div><% end %></div></section><% end %>
<section class="finance-card table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>年月</th><% @names.each do |name| %><th><%= name %></th><% end %><th>合計</th><th>前月比</th><th>増減率</th><th>累計増減</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @records.each_with_index do |record, i| %><% previous = i > 0 ? @records[i - 1] : nil %><tr><td class="nowrap"><%= record.month.strftime("%Y年%m月") %></td><% @names.each do |name| %><td class="amount"><%= record.balances[name].nil? ? "—" : number_with_delimiter(record.balances[name]) %></td><% end %><td class="amount"><strong><%= money(record.total) %></strong></td><td class="amount"><%= previous ? money(record.total - previous.total) : "—" %></td><td><%= previous && previous.total != 0 ? number_to_percentage((record.total - previous.total).fdiv(previous.total) * 100, precision: 1) : "—" %></td><td class="amount"><%= i > 0 ? money(record.total - @records.first.total) : "—" %></td><td class="actions"><%= link_to "編集", edit_finance_snapshot_path(record) %><%= button_to "削除", finance_snapshot_path(record), method: :delete, data: { turbo_confirm: "この月の履歴を削除しますか？" } %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table><% if @records.empty? %><p class="empty">月次残高を記録すると、前月比・増減率・累計増減が表示されます。</p><% end %></section>
<p class="muted">ポイントは1pt＝1円相当。前月比は直前に保存された月との比較です。</p>
